  "notes": [
    "Image paths without extensions resolve to PNG, JPEG, JPG or WebP; zero-padded names map directly to beat IDs.",
    "Absolute seconds, start-inclusive/end-exclusive. Voiceover continues through gestures, holds and transitions.",
    "Each beat zooms in, reveals, holds, shrinks into its cell and holds the board. Completed boards slide left during their last 0.48 seconds.",
    "Reveal is a brush-mask animation of raster artwork. The existing quill hand is mirrored for paired zoom gestures.",
