  ],
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/01",
      "start": 0.0,
      "draw_start": 0.3,
      "draw_end": 2.44,
      "shrink_start": 2.64,
      "shrink_end": 3.06,
      "slide_start": 3.28,
      "end": 3.28,
      "narration": "You’re waiting for the kettle to boil. It will take less than a minute."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/02",
      "start": 3.28,
      "draw_start": 3.58,
      "draw_end": 8.4,
      "shrink_start": 8.6,
      "shrink_end": 9.02,
      "slide_start": 9.24,
      "end": 9.24,
      "narration": "Your hand moves toward your phone anyway. Nothing urgent is there. You just don't want the empty space."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/03",
      "start": 9.24,
      "draw_start": 9.54,
      "draw_end": 13.44,
      "shrink_start": 13.64,
      "shrink_end": 14.06,
      "slide_start": 14.28,
      "end": 14.28,
      "narration": "Most of us know this feeling. The moment the world goes quiet, the mind begins to speak"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/04",
      "start": 14.28,
      "draw_start": 14.58,
      "draw_end": 22.08,
      "shrink_start": 22.28,
      "shrink_end": 22.7,
      "slide_start": 22.92,
      "end": 22.92,
      "narration": "and we reach for something louder. It might be a screen, a task, or another conversation. The thing we choose matters less than how quickly we choose it."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/05",
      "start": 22.92,
      "draw_start": 23.22,
      "draw_end": 32.96,
      "shrink_start": 33.16,
      "shrink_end": 33.58,
      "slide_start": 33.8,
      "end": 33.8,
      "narration": "Carl Jung called the parts of ourselves we struggle to acknowledge the shadow. He wasn't describing a secret monster inside us. The shadow can hold anger, envy, fear, and selfishness."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/06",
      "start": 33.8,
      "draw_start": 34.1,
      "draw_end": 43.12,
      "shrink_start": 43.32,
      "shrink_end": 43.74,
      "slide_start": 44.12,
      "end": 44.6,
      "narration": "It can also hold needs and abilities we learned to hide because they didn't fit the person we thought we had to be. We may not notice these parts directly. But we can notice what happens when they get close."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/07",
      "start": 44.6,
      "draw_start": 44.9,
      "draw_end": 50.52,
      "shrink_start": 50.72,
      "shrink_end": 51.14,
      "slide_start": 51.36,
      "end": 51.36,
      "narration": "That is what makes the idea unsettling. You can sincerely believe you know yourself and still be surprised by your own reaction."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/08",
      "start": 51.36,
      "draw_start": 51.66,
      "draw_end": 55.6,
      "shrink_start": 55.8,
      "shrink_end": 56.22,
      "slide_start": 56.44,
      "end": 56.44,
      "narration": "A part of you wants to be generous; another part wants to be seen. Both may be true."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/09",
      "start": 56.44,
      "draw_start": 56.74,
      "draw_end": 59.68,
      "shrink_start": 59.88,
      "shrink_end": 60.3,
      "slide_start": 60.52,
      "end": 60.52,
      "narration": "Looking inward is less about finding one pure, final version of yourself"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/10",
      "start": 60.52,
      "draw_start": 60.82,
      "draw_end": 63.12,
      "shrink_start": 63.32,
      "shrink_end": 63.74,
      "slide_start": 63.96,
      "end": 63.96,
      "narration": "and more about being honest when different parts of you disagree."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/11",
      "start": 63.96,
      "draw_start": 64.26,
      "draw_end": 65.96,
      "shrink_start": 66.16,
      "shrink_end": 66.58,
      "slide_start": 66.8,
      "end": 66.8,
      "narration": "Here are seven moments worth paying attention to."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/12",
      "start": 66.8,
      "draw_start": 67.1,
      "draw_end": 71.64,
      "shrink_start": 71.84,
      "shrink_end": 72.26,
      "slide_start": 72.64,
      "end": 73.12,
      "narration": "They aren't a test, and none proves anything on its own. Think of them as invitations to ask a better question."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/13",
      "start": 73.12,
      "draw_start": 73.42,
      "draw_end": 76.88,
      "shrink_start": 77.08,
      "shrink_end": 77.5,
      "slide_start": 77.72,
      "end": 77.72,
      "narration": "The first is that every pause needs filling. You put on a podcast to walk to the shop,"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/14",
      "start": 77.72,
      "draw_start": 78.02,
      "draw_end": 81.52,
      "shrink_start": 81.72,
      "shrink_end": 82.14,
      "slide_start": 82.36,
      "end": 82.36,
      "narration": "music to wash a plate, and a video while you eat. Any one of these can be a pleasure."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/15",
      "start": 82.36,
      "draw_start": 82.66,
      "draw_end": 87.04,
      "shrink_start": 87.24,
      "shrink_end": 87.66,
      "slide_start": 87.88,
      "end": 87.88,
      "narration": "But if you feel uneasy the instant there is nothing playing, try asking what the noise is helping you avoid."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/16",
      "start": 87.88,
      "draw_start": 88.18,
      "draw_end": 91.0,
      "shrink_start": 91.2,
      "shrink_end": 91.62,
      "slide_start": 91.84,
      "end": 91.84,
      "narration": "Maybe you're tired. Maybe you're sad. Maybe you have no idea yet."
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/17",
      "start": 91.84,
      "draw_start": 92.14,
      "draw_end": 93.6,
      "shrink_start": 93.8,
      "shrink_end": 94.22,
      "slide_start": 94.44,
      "end": 94.44,
      "narration": "You don't need an answer before the kettle boils."
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/18",
      "start": 94.44,
      "draw_start": 94.74,
      "draw_end": 97.28,
      "shrink_start": 97.48,
      "shrink_end": 97.9,
      "slide_start": 98.28,
      "end": 98.76,
      "narration": "You only need to notice that you reached for one more voice before hearing your own."
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/19",
      "start": 98.76,
      "draw_start": 99.06,
      "draw_end": 105.56,
      "shrink_start": 105.76,
      "shrink_end": 106.18,
      "slide_start": 106.4,
      "end": 106.4,
      "narration": "The second is a reaction that feels bigger than the moment. A colleague talks about their success, and you spend the whole journey home thinking about it."
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/20",
      "start": 106.4,
      "draw_start": 106.7,
      "draw_end": 109.28,
      "shrink_start": 109.48,
      "shrink_end": 109.9,
      "slide_start": 110.12,
      "end": 110.12,
      "narration": "A friend says no to a small favor, and it feels like a betrayal."
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/21",
      "start": 110.12,
      "draw_start": 110.42,
      "draw_end": 116.32,
      "shrink_start": 116.52,
      "shrink_end": 116.94,
      "slide_start": 117.16,
      "end": 117.16,
      "narration": "Sometimes the other person really has behaved badly. But when a minor event stays with you for hours, it may have touched something older:"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/22",
      "start": 117.16,
      "draw_start": 117.46,
      "draw_end": 120.24,
      "shrink_start": 120.44,
      "shrink_end": 120.86,
      "slide_start": 121.08,
      "end": 121.08,
      "narration": "a fear of being left behind, or a wish you don't allow yourself to admit."
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/23",
      "start": 121.08,
      "draw_start": 121.38,
      "draw_end": 125.36,
      "shrink_start": 125.56,
      "shrink_end": 125.98,
      "slide_start": 126.2,
      "end": 126.2,
      "narration": "Jung was interested in how we can see in other people what we have difficulty seeing in ourselves."
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/24",
      "start": 126.2,
      "draw_start": 126.5,
      "draw_end": 131.64,
      "shrink_start": 131.84,
      "shrink_end": 132.26,
      "slide_start": 132.64,
      "end": 133.12,
      "narration": "The useful question isn't, “What's wrong with me for feeling this?” It's, “Why did this particular moment find me so easily?”"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/25",
      "start": 133.12,
      "draw_start": 133.42,
      "draw_end": 141.6,
      "shrink_start": 141.8,
      "shrink_end": 142.22,
      "slide_start": 142.44,
      "end": 142.44,
      "narration": "Third, you become the same person in every room, even when it costs you. You're always easygoing. Always capable. Always the one who understands."
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/26",
      "start": 142.44,
      "draw_start": 142.74,
      "draw_end": 147.56,
      "shrink_start": 147.76,
      "shrink_end": 148.18,
      "slide_start": 148.4,
      "end": 148.4,
      "narration": "People may love that version of you. But if saying “I'm angry,” “I need help,” or “I don't want this”"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/27",
      "start": 148.4,
      "draw_start": 148.7,
      "draw_end": 151.16,
      "shrink_start": 151.36,
      "shrink_end": 151.78,
      "slide_start": 152.0,
      "end": 152.0,
      "narration": "feels almost impossible, the role has become very small."
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/28",
      "start": 152.0,
      "draw_start": 152.3,
      "draw_end": 155.84,
      "shrink_start": 156.04,
      "shrink_end": 156.46,
      "slide_start": 156.68,
      "end": 156.68,
      "narration": "Jung used the word persona for the face we show the world. We all need one."
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/29",
      "start": 156.68,
      "draw_start": 156.98,
      "draw_end": 160.08,
      "shrink_start": 160.28,
      "shrink_end": 160.7,
      "slide_start": 160.92,
      "end": 160.92,
      "narration": "The trouble begins when keeping that face intact matters more than telling the truth."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/30",
      "start": 160.92,
      "draw_start": 161.22,
      "draw_end": 163.4,
      "shrink_start": 163.6,
      "shrink_end": 164.02,
      "slide_start": 164.4,
      "end": 164.88,
      "narration": "What you hide does not vanish just because you've become good at hiding it."
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/31",
      "start": 164.88,
      "draw_start": 165.18,
      "draw_end": 167.44,
      "shrink_start": 167.64,
      "shrink_end": 168.06,
      "slide_start": 168.28,
      "end": 168.28,
      "narration": "Fourth, you stay busy long after the work is done."
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/32",
      "start": 168.28,
      "draw_start": 168.58,
      "draw_end": 170.4,
      "shrink_start": 170.6,
      "shrink_end": 171.02,
      "slide_start": 171.24,
      "end": 171.24,
      "narration": "You finish one task and immediately invent another."
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/33",
      "start": 171.24,
      "draw_start": 171.54,
      "draw_end": 175.28,
      "shrink_start": 175.48,
      "shrink_end": 175.9,
      "slide_start": 176.12,
      "end": 176.12,
      "narration": "You call it discipline, and perhaps some of it is. But notice what happens if you stop."
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/34",
      "start": 176.12,
      "draw_start": 176.42,
      "draw_end": 181.48,
      "shrink_start": 181.68,
      "shrink_end": 182.1,
      "slide_start": 182.32,
      "end": 182.32,
      "narration": "Do you feel rested, or do you feel guilty? Do you know what you want to do with an evening that doesn't have to produce anything?"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/35",
      "start": 182.32,
      "draw_start": 182.62,
      "draw_end": 184.32,
      "shrink_start": 184.52,
      "shrink_end": 184.94,
      "slide_start": 185.16,
      "end": 185.16,
      "narration": "Sometimes productivity is a way to build a life."
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/36",
      "start": 185.16,
      "draw_start": 185.46,
      "draw_end": 189.24,
      "shrink_start": 189.44,
      "shrink_end": 189.86,
      "slide_start": 190.24,
      "end": 190.72,
      "narration": "Sometimes it's a way to avoid asking whether you like the life you're building. The calendar can't answer that for you."
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/37",
      "start": 190.72,
      "draw_start": 191.02,
      "draw_end": 196.72,
      "shrink_start": 196.92,
      "shrink_end": 197.34,
      "slide_start": 197.56,
      "end": 197.56,
      "narration": "Fifth, the same conflict keeps finding you in different people. One friendship ends because you felt taken for granted."
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/38",
      "start": 197.56,
      "draw_start": 197.86,
      "draw_end": 202.2,
      "shrink_start": 202.4,
      "shrink_end": 202.82,
      "slide_start": 203.04,
      "end": 203.04,
      "narration": "Then another begins to feel strangely familiar. The names change, but your part of the story doesn't."
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/39",
      "start": 203.04,
      "draw_start": 203.34,
      "draw_end": 207.6,
      "shrink_start": 207.8,
      "shrink_end": 208.22,
      "slide_start": 208.44,
      "end": 208.44,
      "narration": "This does not mean everything that happened was your fault. It means there may be a pattern worth examining."
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/40",
      "start": 208.44,
      "draw_start": 208.74,
      "draw_end": 209.92,
      "shrink_start": 210.12,
      "shrink_end": 210.54,
      "slide_start": 210.76,
      "end": 210.76,
      "narration": "Perhaps you agree to things you resent later."
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/41",
      "start": 210.76,
      "draw_start": 211.06,
      "draw_end": 213.04,
      "shrink_start": 213.24,
      "shrink_end": 213.66,
      "slide_start": 213.88,
      "end": 213.88,
      "narration": "Perhaps you expect people to guess a need you never say aloud."
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/42",
      "start": 213.88,
      "draw_start": 214.18,
      "draw_end": 218.28,
      "shrink_start": 218.48,
      "shrink_end": 218.9,
      "slide_start": 219.28,
      "end": 219.76,
      "narration": "Repetition is uncomfortable because it asks you to look at the one person present in every version of the story."
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/43",
      "start": 219.76,
      "draw_start": 220.06,
      "draw_end": 222.24,
      "shrink_start": 222.44,
      "shrink_end": 222.86,
      "slide_start": 223.08,
      "end": 223.08,
      "narration": "Sixth, you judge your own feelings before you understand them."
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/44",
      "start": 223.08,
      "draw_start": 223.38,
      "draw_end": 225.6,
      "shrink_start": 225.8,
      "shrink_end": 226.22,
      "slide_start": 226.44,
      "end": 226.44,
      "narration": "You feel jealous, then tell yourself a decent person wouldn't."
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/45",
      "start": 226.44,
      "draw_start": 226.74,
      "draw_end": 228.92,
      "shrink_start": 229.12,
      "shrink_end": 229.54,
      "slide_start": 229.76,
      "end": 229.76,
      "narration": "You feel angry, then rush to explain why you shouldn't be."
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/46",
      "start": 229.76,
      "draw_start": 230.06,
      "draw_end": 231.92,
      "shrink_start": 232.12,
      "shrink_end": 232.54,
      "slide_start": 232.76,
      "end": 232.76,
      "narration": "But a feeling is information, not an instruction."
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/47",
      "start": 232.76,
      "draw_start": 233.06,
      "draw_end": 237.92,
      "shrink_start": 238.12,
      "shrink_end": 238.54,
      "slide_start": 238.76,
      "end": 238.76,
      "narration": "Jealousy might reveal a wish. Anger might point to a boundary. Neither tells you automatically what to do."
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/48",
      "start": 238.76,
      "draw_start": 239.06,
      "draw_end": 244.52,
      "shrink_start": 244.72,
      "shrink_end": 245.14,
      "slide_start": 245.52,
      "end": 246.0,
      "narration": "When you treat the feeling as forbidden, you lose the chance to find out what it was trying to tell you. You can listen without handing it the steering wheel."
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/49",
      "start": 246.0,
      "draw_start": 246.3,
      "draw_end": 249.48,
      "shrink_start": 249.68,
      "shrink_end": 250.1,
      "slide_start": 250.32,
      "end": 250.32,
      "narration": "And the seventh is the hardest to spot: you already know the question you're avoiding."
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/50",
      "start": 250.32,
      "draw_start": 250.62,
      "draw_end": 253.4,
      "shrink_start": 253.6,
      "shrink_end": 254.02,
      "slide_start": 254.24,
      "end": 254.24,
      "narration": "It comes back when you turn out the light. Am I happy in this relationship?"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/51",
      "start": 254.24,
      "draw_start": 254.54,
      "draw_end": 259.12,
      "shrink_start": 259.32,
      "shrink_end": 259.74,
      "slide_start": 259.96,
      "end": 259.96,
      "narration": "Do I still believe in this goal? What would I choose if nobody expected me to be who I was five years ago?"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/52",
      "start": 259.96,
      "draw_start": 260.26,
      "draw_end": 261.56,
      "shrink_start": 261.76,
      "shrink_end": 262.18,
      "slide_start": 262.4,
      "end": 262.4,
      "narration": "You don't have to make a dramatic decision tonight."
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/53",
      "start": 262.4,
      "draw_start": 262.7,
      "draw_end": 264.12,
      "shrink_start": 264.32,
      "shrink_end": 264.74,
      "slide_start": 264.96,
      "end": 264.96,
      "narration": "But there is a difference between taking time to think"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/54",
      "start": 264.96,
      "draw_start": 265.26,
      "draw_end": 266.24,
      "shrink_start": 266.44,
      "shrink_end": 266.86,
      "slide_start": 267.24,
      "end": 267.72,
      "narration": "and keeping yourself too distracted to begin."
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/55",
      "start": 267.72,
      "draw_start": 268.02,
      "draw_end": 276.88,
      "shrink_start": 277.08,
      "shrink_end": 277.5,
      "slide_start": 277.72,
      "end": 277.72,
      "narration": "None of this means you should spend every quiet minute digging through your past. Rest is allowed. Entertainment is allowed. Sometimes a podcast is just a good podcast."
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/56",
      "start": 277.72,
      "draw_start": 278.02,
      "draw_end": 282.32,
      "shrink_start": 282.52,
      "shrink_end": 282.94,
      "slide_start": 283.16,
      "end": 283.16,
      "narration": "The point is to notice whether you can choose these things freely, or whether silence makes the choice for you."
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/57",
      "start": 283.16,
      "draw_start": 283.46,
      "draw_end": 290.84,
      "shrink_start": 291.04,
      "shrink_end": 291.46,
      "slide_start": 291.68,
      "end": 291.68,
      "narration": "And if what comes up feels overwhelming, you don't have to handle it alone. A trusted person or a mental health professional can help you make sense of it."
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/58",
      "start": 291.68,
      "draw_start": 291.98,
      "draw_end": 294.88,
      "shrink_start": 295.08,
      "shrink_end": 295.5,
      "slide_start": 295.72,
      "end": 295.72,
      "narration": "Being honest with yourself can include asking someone else to sit with you while you do it."
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/59",
      "start": 295.72,
      "draw_start": 296.02,
      "draw_end": 307.0,
      "shrink_start": 307.2,
      "shrink_end": 307.62,
      "slide_start": 307.84,
      "end": 307.84,
      "narration": "So the next time your hand reaches for the phone in a quiet moment, you might leave it there for a few seconds. Notice what thought arrives. You don't have to believe it, fix it, or turn it into a lesson. Just let it be heard."
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/60",
      "start": 307.84,
      "draw_start": 308.14,
      "draw_end": 312.32,
      "shrink_start": 312.52,
      "shrink_end": 312.94,
      "slide_start": 313.32,
      "end": 313.32,
      "narration": "The thought you've been avoiding may be painful. It may also be the first honest thing you've told yourself in a while."
    }
  ],
